@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam roundcorner 10

box "User Space (Go Daemon)" #F9F9F9
participant "Event Loop\n(eventsChan)" as GoMain
participant "K8s Watcher" as GoWatcher
participant "CGroup Mapper" as GoMapper
participant "Prometheus\nMetrics" as Prom
end box

box "Kernel Space" #EFEFEF
participant "eBPF Probes" as eBPF
participant "BPF Maps\n(filter + ringbuf)" as BPFMaps
participant "Filesystem\n(VFS / OverlayFS)" as Kernel
end box

box "Container" #FFFFFF
participant "Pod Application" as PodApp
end box

== Initialization Phase ==
GoMain -> BPFMaps: Load eBPF + Initialize Maps
GoMain -> GoMapper: Build cgroup inode → path map
GoMapper -> BPFMaps: Populate cgroup_filter
GoMain -> GoWatcher: Start Pod Watcher
GoWatcher -> GoMain: Build Pod metadata cache
GoMain -> Kernel: Attach probes (fentry, kprobes)
GoMain -> BPFMaps: Bind ring buffer → eventsChan

== Runtime Event Flow (Example: mkdir) ==
PodApp -> Kernel: Syscall (mkdir)
Kernel -> eBPF: Trigger probe (vfs_mkdir)

eBPF -> BPFMaps: Check cgroup_filter
alt Not monitored
    BPFMaps --> eBPF: No match
    eBPF --> Kernel: Ignore event
else Monitored
    BPFMaps --> eBPF: Match found
    eBPF -> BPFMaps: Reserve ringbuf event
    eBPF -> eBPF: Fill event (type, cgroup, delta)
    eBPF -> BPFMaps: Submit event
    eBPF --> Kernel: Continue syscall
end

Kernel --> PodApp: Return result

== Userspace Processing ==
BPFMaps -->> GoMain: Event via ring buffer

GoMain -> GoMain: Decode event struct
GoMain -> GoMapper: cgroup → path
GoMapper --> GoMain: Return path

GoMain -> GoMain: Extract Pod UID
GoMain -> GoWatcher: UID → Pod info
GoWatcher --> GoMain: Pod name + namespace

GoMain -> Prom: Update metrics
Prom --> GoMain: Done

@enduml